error[L0209]: `run` cannot appear in a proposition: it does not promise terminates
  --> tests/corpus/reject/fn_in_proposition.lc:10:26
   |
10 | fn about_run(n: u8) -> @(run(n) == n) { //~ error: L0209 `run` cannot appear in a proposition: it does not promise terminates
   |                          ^^^^^^
   |
   = note: a function appears in a proposition when it promises `terminates`, `no_panic`, and `no_io` and takes no `&mut`, so that mentioning it runs nothing and denotes one value; a `math fn` promises the three
